#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:104
msgid "Invalid framesize constants removed *(minor)*"
msgstr "Constantes de framesize no válidas eliminadas *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:106
msgid ""
"The invalid ``sensor.QQQQCIF`` / ``QQQCIF`` / ``QQQQSIF`` / ``QQQSIF`` / "
"``HQQQQVGA`` / ``HVGA`` framesize constants were removed (#261). Scripts "
"using these must switch to a supported resolution."
msgstr ""
"Se eliminaron las constantes de framesize no válidas ``sensor.QQQQCIF`` / "
"``QQQCIF`` / ``QQQQSIF`` / ``QQQSIF`` / ``HQQQQVGA`` / ``HVGA`` (#261). Los "
"scripts que las usen deben cambiar a una resolución compatible."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:110
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `35ab0a26f <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/35ab0a26f>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `35ab0a26f <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/35ab0a26f>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:115
msgid "``find_qrcodes()`` removed on the OpenMV Cam M4 *(minor)*"
msgstr "``find_qrcodes()`` eliminado en la OpenMV Cam M4 *(minor)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:117
msgid ""
"``image.find_qrcodes()`` is no longer compiled in on M4-class (OpenMV 2) "
"boards. Use an OpenMV 3 (M7) board or another code feature for QR detection "
"on M4 hardware. Other boards are unaffected."
msgstr ""
"``image.find_qrcodes()`` ya no se compila en las placas de clase M4 (OpenMV "
"2). Usa una placa OpenMV 3 (M7) u otra función del código para la detección "
"de QR en hardware M4. Las demás placas no se ven afectadas."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:121
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `7dff089e6 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7dff089e6>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `7dff089e6 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/7dff089e6>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:126
msgid "MicroPython updated to 1.9.2 *(behavior)*"
msgstr "MicroPython actualizado a la 1.9.2 *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:128
msgid ""
"The bundled MicroPython core was updated to 1.9.2. Standard-library and "
"language behavior follows upstream MicroPython 1.9.2 — re-check scripts that"
" depend on version-specific behavior. Notably, an image slice with a step "
"other than 1 now raises ``OSError`` instead of ``NotImplementedError``."
msgstr ""
"El núcleo de MicroPython incluido se actualizó a la 1.9.2. El comportamiento"
" de la biblioteca estándar y del lenguaje sigue al de MicroPython 1.9.2 "
"upstream — revisa de nuevo los scripts que dependan de comportamientos "
"específicos de la versión. En particular, un slice de imagen con un paso "
"distinto de 1 ahora lanza ``OSError`` en lugar de ``NotImplementedError``."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:133
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `11bed4b99 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/11bed4b99>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commits:* `11bed4b99 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/11bed4b99>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:138
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Lista de comprobación de migración"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:140
msgid "For a clean port to v2.6.0 the typical work is:"
msgstr "Para un port limpio a la v2.6.0 el trabajo habitual es:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:142
msgid ""
"Rewrite ``find_line_segments()`` calls for the LSD parameters "
"(``merge_distance`` / ``max_theta_diff``) and move that processing off the "
"M4 (:ref:`the LSD rework <v2_6_0_lsd>`)."
msgstr ""
"Reescribir las llamadas a ``find_line_segments()`` para los parámetros de "
"LSD (``merge_distance`` / ``max_theta_diff``) y mover ese procesamiento "
"fuera de la M4 (:ref:`la reescritura de LSD <v2_6_0_lsd>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:145
msgid ""
"Replace removed framesize constants with a supported resolution (:ref:`the "
"framesize removal <v2_6_0_framesizes>`)."
msgstr ""
"Reemplazar las constantes de framesize eliminadas por una resolución "
"compatible (:ref:`la eliminación de framesizes <v2_6_0_framesizes>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:147
msgid ""
"Move M4 QR-code detection to an M7 board (:ref:`the find_qrcodes change "
"<v2_6_0_qrcodes>`)."
msgstr ""
"Mover la detección de códigos QR de la M4 a una placa M7 (:ref:`el cambio de"
" find_qrcodes <v2_6_0_qrcodes>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:149
msgid ""
"Re-validate version-specific behavior against MicroPython 1.9.2 (:ref:`the "
"MicroPython bump <v2_6_0_micropython>`)."
msgstr ""
"Volver a validar el comportamiento específico de la versión frente a "
"MicroPython 1.9.2 (:ref:`la actualización de MicroPython "
"<v2_6_0_micropython>`)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.6.0.rst:152
msgid "All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr "Todos los demás scripts se ejecutan sin cambios."
